  "historyNote": "#2116, eff 8-12-82; ss by #2828, eff 8-20-84; ss by #4546, eff 12-16-88, EXPIRED 12-16-94 New. #6011, eff 3-28-95; amd by #6060, EMERGENCY, eff 7-11-95, EXPIRES 11-8-95; ss by #6011, eff 3-28-95; ss by #6959, eff 3-23-99; ss by #7452, eff 2-22-01; ss by #8423, eff 8-31-05; ss by #8848, eff 3-21-07, EXPIRED: 3-21-15 (from Agr 2102.04) New. #10975, eff 11-19-15; ss by #14564, eff 4-23-26, EXPIRES: 4-23-36",
